  "description": "Weapon Tooltip Preview\nBecause I like to see pewpew on the fly.\n\nSource code\n\nRequired mods: LunaLib, LazyLib\n\nSafe to add mid-game\n\nNo known mod conflicts\n\nWhat is this?\n\nJust scratching an old itch to see weapons firing on hover, because I can't be bothered to refit and go into the simulator just to isolate one firing pattern and see the satisfying pewpew.\n\nSupports Weapons\nSupports Wings (and their weapons)\nSupports Refit Fleet data (and mods altering it such as SiC)\nSupports all modded weapons (in theory)\nSupports GraphicsLib\n\nSome previews\n\nFrom Cargo with generic ships... ... and Refit with actual stats\n\nWorks with Wings... ...and with Modded weapons Showcases PD weapons with Missiles... ...and Wings the player can cycle through\n\nFAQ\nDoes it work with other Mods?\nIn theory, yes. It creates a dedicated CombatEngine and uses actual ship & weapon data. So any weapon data available in mods should work.\n\nDo you plan to update it?\nIf there is a legit need to, yes.\n\nCan I change the settings?\nYes, there are a couple settings.\n\nAI use disclaimer\nSome code in this mod was created using AI tools:\n\nCode: Claude Code Opus 5.5\n\nEverything was reviewed to the best of my ability and understanding. OpenGL shenanigans are above my paygrade so anyone willing to give it a second sanity-check is more than welcome.\n\nFor bug reports, include your game and mod versions, enabled mods and steps to reproduce the problem. A relevant log or screenshot helps!",
